//! Composition ownership for one replacement semantic session and Vulkan epoch.
//!
//! This module is intentionally not connected to packet ingress before the
//! whole-device cutover. It owns the complete replacement pipeline lifecycles
//! now so the cutover cannot introduce a second ad-hoc pipeline map beside the
//! generational semantic owner.

